<para>allocation for SIMD <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">cslt::HeapAllocator<sp/>allocator;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Allocate<sp/>512<sp/>bytes<sp/>aligned<sp/>to<sp/>64-byte<sp/>cache<sp/>line</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>allocator.alloc_aligned(512,<sp/>64,<sp/>false);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(result.hasValue())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>void*<sp/>ptr<sp/>=<sp/>result.value();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
